{
  "schema": 1,
  "note": "D12 P10 / D23 T1-M fixed gear kits for sim_power.gd --gear-kit=NAME. Items are written as base + affix lines and built by tests/support/gear_kits.gd with the grammar of loot.gd (stats = base stats + lines + legendary stats, clamped to limits). Measuring never reads or writes a data file or a save.",
  "composition": "Hand-composed from today's live loot.json: sim_loot.gd has no wear policy (the F2 policy of D12 P10 does not exist yet), so each kit is a representative wear built by one rule: mid-range line values of the live tier that the kit's item level allows, a rare carries 2-3 lines, magic 1, no line is repeated within a group, a slot gets damage lines only on weapon / hands / ring / charm (the slots whose live rows carry them). Item levels: d1_start 3-6, d1_end 9-11, d2_mid 14. Required levels are NOT enforced by the bench (it throws experience away; the hero stays at level 1).",
  "needs_tags": {
    "pool": "a line whose id is only in loot.json affix_rolls.pool (not in the live `affixes`): the core's validate() refuses it until T1-A reads the pool. The bench measures it anyway because the stat key (damage_bps) is read today.",
    "T1-B": "the damage-reduction sum cap (7500) is not in the core yet: the bench reports the sum and 'cap not applied'."
  },
  "kits": {
